# Artifacts left behind by trying the documented curl examples in this
# directory. The base64 and html2pdf examples write their output to a file, so
# anyone following the docs produces these; they are results, not source.
decoded.bin
invoice.pdf
*.qr.png

# The OpenAPI document is generated and verified against the live service. It
# is committed deliberately when complete - see the note in its own commit -
# rather than picked up as a stray working file.

# Agent session state, dropped into every checkout by AgentSyncToolkit. Session
# transcripts, not source - 6.3 MB of them across this repo on 2026-08-25. The
# copy under web/ is the one that matters: that directory is mirrored to the
# `website` branch, which is the document root of aisense.no, so a committed
# .agent-state/ would be served as static files off the live domain.
.agent-state/

# Same origin, same reason. These two are synced into each checkout rather than
# written for this project, and under web/ they would publish as
# https://aisense.no/AGENTS.md. Ignored inside web/ only - whether the repo root
# should carry its own AGENTS.md is a separate question.
web/AGENTS.md
web/AGENT_CONTEXT.md
